{"id":"n86627-1-7","stage":3,"title":"호박 · 南瓜","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86627-1-7-1","ko":"이 풀은 뭐니?","zh":"这是什么植物？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"풀은","meaning":"草","explanation":"풀：草；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"풀","audio":"/audio/9f4ab3b56eddc42cf4c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73268","senseId":"1","lemma":"풀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풀은","audio":"/audio/4784b87ee762de3a2777.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐니?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐니","audio":"/audio/c123f71de2e0a9dffdf5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"9f4ab3b56eddc42c","term":"풀","zh":"草","audio":"/audio/9f4ab3b56eddc42cf4c9.mp3","entryId":"73268","definition":"一种茎秆柔软的植物，大部分为一年生。","pronunciation":["풀"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/6b858a141f2a384f4ef3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86627-1-7-2","ko":"호박인데 아직 열매가 열리지 않았어.","zh":"是南瓜，还没结果。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"호박인데","meaning":"南瓜","explanation":"호박：南瓜；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"호박","audio":"/audio/1fb060f59a078e40db94.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86627","senseId":"1","lemma":"호박","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"호박인데","audio":"/audio/8d6ad5d2ad5f3dde7212.mp3"}},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"열매가","meaning":"果实","explanation":"열매：果实；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"열매","audio":"/audio/34e07c18fd5adbdaefab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14093","senseId":"1","lemma":"열매","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열매가","audio":"/audio/44bb5d89675b73ac0ea4.mp3"}},{"text":"열리지","meaning":"结果，结实","explanation":"열리다：结果，结实；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"열리다","audio":"/audio/b6ba3a226396d7d01d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14091","senseId":"1","lemma":"열리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열리지","audio":"/audio/cad4626227d4b03ec467.mp3"}},{"text":"않았어.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않았어","audio":"/audio/5a7720bef7cd2ac4fcc3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1fb060f59a078e40","term":"호박","zh":"南瓜","audio":"/audio/1fb060f59a078e40db94.mp3","entryId":"86627","definition":"叶子大，开喇叭形黄花，结大圆形果实的爬蔓植物。","pronunciation":["호ː박"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"34e07c18fd5adbda","term":"열매","zh":"果实","audio":"/audio/34e07c18fd5adbdaefab.mp3","entryId":"14093","definition":"像苹果、梨等一样树花谢之后从该位置长出来的东西。","pronunciation":["열매"]},{"id":"b6ba3a226396d7d0","term":"열리다","zh":"结果，结实","audio":"/audio/b6ba3a226396d7d01d21.mp3","entryId":"14091","definition":"树枝上结出果实。","pronunciation":["열리다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/620ea14837fc1b373ce2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.73,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86627","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":96,"sequenceScore":2.5567,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是南瓜，还没结果。","这是什么植物？","这栋公寓的竣工年份是哪一年呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这是什么植物？","这栋公寓的竣工年份是哪一年呢？","是南瓜，还没结果。"],"answer":2}]}
